<title>CHINA: China Jan-May antimony exports up 33.6 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>China Jan-May antimony exports up 33.6 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's exports of unwrought antimony reached 14,695 tonnes in the first five months, up 33.6 percent compared with the year-ago period, customs figures showed on Tuesday.</p>
<p>	     EXPORTS JAN-MAY	  MAY    YR/YR PCTAGE CHANGE</p>
<p> Antimony     14,695		 3,441	+33.6</p>
<p>-- Beijing newsroom (8610) 6532 1921</p>
</text>
